  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru-verb ({加点|かてん}する). Common in education (grading, exams) and sports (scoring). The opposite is {減点|げんてん} (point deduction).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {加点|かてん}する (to add points)\n- {加点|かてん}される (to have points added)\n- {加点|かてん}{方式|ほうしき} (additive scoring system)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {減点|げんてん}: deduction of points — the opposite, subtracting points for errors\n- {得点|とくてん}: score, points earned — the total points one has obtained",
